Yes — and I want to be **extra careful with Stage 12**, because this is where we stop treating the CoinDesk scraper as a learning script and start turning it into a **real production-grade scraping system**. The master roadmap explicitly puts architecture, configuration, scheduling, logging, retries, monitoring, alerts, and metrics here, immediately before the multi-source financial-data stage.

I’d keep it to **4 lessons**, but unlike earlier stages, these lessons will be substantial implementation milestones.

